## Zero-Waste Design Method<br>
<br>
* Description: Designing garments that generate minimal waste during production and consumption<br>
* Examples:<br>
	+ Using digital printing to minimize fabric waste<br>
	+ Designing garments with interchangeable parts to reduce waste during manufacturing<br>
